Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.02,0:23:50.03,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正兰亭中黑_GBK\fs90\bord10\shad0\b0\blur2\c&HFF42A9&\3c&HBDF71E&\pos(712.8,996)}太好了 到外面啦 我自由啦
